     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"DE-CH\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Here is an interesting offer for a postdoc position. The closing date is very soon, however!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Subject:\r\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Postdoc position in evolutionary ecology<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:#feec97\">** Caution: EXTERNAL Sender **</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I have a 3.5 year postdoc position advertised (funded by UK NERC).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The aim is to quantify spatio-temporal variation in selection on seasonal migration,\r\n<span style=\"color:black\">using multi-year multi-location capture-mark-recapture data from a partially migratory bird meta-population (European shags). The post is part of a wider project on eco-evolutionary dynamics in seasonally mobile systems.</span><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It would suit someone who’s interested in the interfaces between population ecology, evolutionary ecology, movement ecology and demography, and who could enjoy getting tangled up in Bayesian capture-mark-recapture…<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It’s based at University of Aberdeen (UK), but also with time spent at NTNU (Norway).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I would very much appreciate if you could circulate and flag up to anyone who might be interested (details below, closing date July 15 2024).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Many thanks for your help and best wishes,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Jane<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">Postdoctoral Research Fellow position in Evolutionary Ecology.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">Estimating\r\n<span>spatio</span>-temporal variation in selection on seasonal migration, using multi-year multi-location capture-mark-recapture data from a partially migratory bird population.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">Based at University of Aberdeen, UK, with some time spent at NTNU, Norway, collaborating with UK Centre for Ecology &amp; Hydrology.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">Fully funded for 3.5 years, by UK Natural Environment Research Council.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://www.abdnjobs.co.uk/vacancy/research-fellow--559960.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.abdnjobs.co.uk/vacancy/research-fellow--559960.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492825140000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28UT9inAAWBJ16UsMfHfia\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">https://www.abdnjobs.co.uk/vacancy/research-fellow--559960.html</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">Closing date for applications: July 15th<span> 2024</span>.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">Please contact Jane Reid if you are interested or for further information (</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">jane....@ntnu.no</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">\r\n or </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">jane...@abdn.ac.uk</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:black\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe University of Aberdeen is a charity registered in Scotland, No SC013683.<br>\r\nTha Oilthigh Obar Dheathain na charthannas clàraichte ann an Alba, Àir. SC013683.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
